  "notes": {
   "linuxserver": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-sealskin/compare/0.4.1-ls6...0.4.2-ls7",
   "upstream": "# SealSkin 0.4.2\n\nMaintenance release.\n\n## Changes\n\n* **PRoot Apps catalogs from a private remote.** When\n  `SEALSKIN_PROOT_APPS_REMOTE` names a private proot-apps repository, its\n  apps keep their short names in a catalog. A session on a catalog now gets\n  `PA_DEFAULT_REPO`, the registry of that remote, so `proot-apps install\n  <app>` and the app's desktop entries resolve to the private registry\n  rather than `ghcr.io/linuxserver/proot-apps`. Apps of any other remote are\n  still installed by their full image name.\n* Dependency updates for the server and the client.\n",
   "upstream_url": "https://github.com/selkies-project/sealskin/releases/tag/0.4.2"
  },
